# ══ READ FIRST: THIS FILE HAS AN 8 KiB RULE BUDGET ═════════════════════════
# Cloudflare Pages strips comments and blank lines, then caps the remaining RULE
# content at 8192 bytes. Anything past that byte is SILENTLY DROPPED: no build
# error, no warning, nothing in the deploy log. The rules just never fire and
# their URLs serve 404s.
#
# This bit us for a month. On 2026-08-04 we measured production and found only
# the first 148 of 202 rules were live. The dead tail included the `/us/*`
# migration catch-all (so every former /us/ URL 404'd) and 12 UK blog 301s.
#
# RULES FOR EDITING THIS FILE
#   1. Comments are FREE. Document as much as you like.
#   2. Rule lines are NOT free, and alignment padding counts. Use single spaces.
#   3. Prefer one :placeholder or /* rule over N repeated explicit rules.
#   4. `npm run validate` fails the build if you cross the cap. Do not bypass it.
#   5. Cloudflare's documented "2,100 static rules" limit is real but is NOT the
#      binding constraint here. The byte budget is. Ignore the rule count.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
